@DevOpsDemo_HostAddress = https://localhost:7098

### Hent hele kataloget
GET {{DevOpsDemo_HostAddress}}/api/books
Accept: application/json

### Hent en bog (id 1 findes i startdata)
GET {{DevOpsDemo_HostAddress}}/api/books/1

### Opret en bog: forvent 201 og en Location-header med det nye id
POST {{DevOpsDemo_HostAddress}}/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Min nye bog",
  "author": "En forfatter",
  "isRead": false
}

### PUT erstatter alle redigerbare oplysninger
PUT {{DevOpsDemo_HostAddress}}/api/books/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Den lille havfrue",
  "author": "H. C. Andersen",
  "isRead": true
}

### Slet bogen: forvent 204 uden JSON-indhold (genstart gendanner startdata)
DELETE {{DevOpsDemo_HostAddress}}/api/books/1

### Ukendt id: forvent 404 Problem Details
GET {{DevOpsDemo_HostAddress}}/api/books/999999

### Ugyldig titel: forvent 400 med valideringsfejl
POST {{DevOpsDemo_HostAddress}}/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "   ",
  "author": "En forfatter",
  "isRead": false
}

### Health check til drift og Azure
GET {{DevOpsDemo_HostAddress}}/health
